rl":"https://www.parliament.gov.fj/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Fiji-Police-Force-Annual-Report-2017–18.pdf","licence":"no licence stated","years":"2016-17 to 2017-18 (fiscal years Aug-Jul)","notes":"Annual Crime Statistics table, rows 16-19 (Murder, Attempted Murder, Manslaughter, Infanticide), columns South, West, East, North, Total. PDF downloaded with curl, pdftotext -layout, rows parsed by script; division values sum to the published totals."},"fpf_ar_2018_19":{"name":"Fiji Police Force August 2018 to July 2019 Annual Report - Table 76.0 Comparison of Crime Cases Registered by Division during the Financial Year 2018-2019","publisher":"Fiji Police Force (tabled in Parliament of Fiji)","url":"https://www.parliament.gov.fj/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/50-Fiji-Police-Force-August-2018-to-July-2019-Annual-Report.pdf","licence":"This publication is a Copyright. All rights reserved. No part of this publicatioin shall be reproduced, transmitted, represented, or copied in any means without the written permission of the publisher.","years":"2017-18 to 2018-19","notes":"Table 76.0 rows 16-19, columns Central, South, West, East, North, Total."},"fpf_ar_2019_20":{"name":"Fiji Police Force Annual Report August 2019-July 2020 - Comparison of Crime Cases Registered by Division","publisher":"Fiji Police Force (tabled in Parliament of Fiji)","url":"https://www.parliament.gov.fj/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Fiji-Police-Force-Annual-Report-August-2019%E2%80%93July-2020.pdf","licence":"no licence stated","years":"2018-19 to 2019-20","notes":"Annual crime statistics table rows 16-19, columns Central, South, West, East, North, Total."},"fpf_ar_2021_22":{"name":"Fiji Police Force Annual Report 2021/22 - Table 79 Comparison of Crime Cases Registered by Division during the Financial Year 2021-2022","publisher":"Fiji Police Force (tabled in Parliament of Fiji)","url":"https://parliament.gov.fj/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/54Fiji-Police-Force-Annual-Report-2021-2022.pdf","licence":"no licence stated","years":"2020-21 to 2021-22","notes":"Table 79, 'Offences against the Person' block: Murder, Manslaughter, Manslaughter arising from a breach of duty, Attempted murder, Attempted infanticide; columns South, West, East, North, Central, Total."}},"dict":{"b":["Total"],"m":["Crime cases registered: Murder","Crime cases registered: Attempted murder","Crime cases registered: Manslaughter","Crime cases registered: Infanticide","Crime cases registered: Manslaughter arising from a breach of duty","Crime cases registered: Attempted infanticide"],"u":["count"],"s":["fpf_ar_2017_18","fpf_ar_2018_19","fpf_ar_2019_20","fpf_ar_2021_22"],"c":["2016-17","2017-18","2018-19","2019-20","2020-21","2021-22"]},"problems":"# Fiji - problems and notes\n\n- Source: Fiji Police Force annual reports (tabled in Parliament, parliament.gov.fj). Each has an \"Annual Crime Statistics\" table of crime cases registered by police division for two fiscal years (August-July). Values are crime cases registered, not victims.\n- Overlapping years: each report repeats the previous year. Both copies are kept with their own source_key. They match for 2017-18 (Central/South only in the 2018-19 report) and 2018-19.\n- Division set changes: the 2017-18 report has only South, West, East and North. Its \"Southern Division\" figure (8 murders in 2017-18) equals Central (5) + South (3) in the 2018-19 report, so Central was counted inside South there. Recorded as published.\n- 2020-21 figures come only from the 2021-22 report (Table 79). The 2020-21 annual report (https://www.parliament.gov.fj/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Fiji-Police-Force-Annual-Report-August-2020%E2%80%93July-2021.pdf, downloaded) has no table of crimes by division; it only gives national autopsy counts by cause.\n- The 2021-22 table uses finer categories (Manslaughter split from \"Manslaughter arising from a breach of duty\"; Attempted infanticide). Infanticide is not listed in that table.\n- Attempted murder rows are included because the table publishes them; they are not deaths.\n- Each report also has a national table of autopsies by cause including \"Murder\" (by method: assault, stabbing, strangulation...). It is national only, so not extracted.\n- Not done: FY 2022-23 onward reports were not found on parliament.gov.fj in this search. Fiji Bureau of Statistics: no crime-by-division table found. ODPP Fiji monthly \"Serious Crime Statistics\" (odpp.com.fj) give murder charges filed per month nationally, with no area split; not extracted.\n- Licence: only the 2018-19 report states one (\"Copyright. All rights reserved ... without the written permission of the publisher\").","unmatched":1,"shapes":{"shapes_ADM1.geojson":{"source":"geoBoundaries gbOpen FJI ADM1","url":"https://github.com/wmgeolab/geoBoundaries/raw/9469f09/releaseData/gbOpen/FJI/ADM1/geoBoundaries-FJI-ADM1.geojson","licence":"Creative Commons Attribution 2.5 Generic","year":"2006"}}}